ht--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mind 5, Life 5, Entropy 5, Time 5.<br /> <br /> Timetravel to the age when humans were created, then insert in the mind of the first humans the a sort of cognitive genetic virus that makes them believe that every experience that they can remember was worse than the experience that they're living now, thus creating the ilusion that every past moment was worse, and they're better than before. Make this condition hereditary, with a 100% chances of being inherited. Since the Consensus it's ruled by human perception of reality, the world it's always getting &amp;quot;better&amp;quot; than before (even if people isn't good at all, because the past was always worse) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Nice one!<br /> <br /> IF humans have the most power over the Consensus...<br /> Probably the right method to put the theorem to a test.<br /> <br /> <b>New Challenge</b><br /> Create a stone you can not lift.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T15:53:07-08:00","id":1027885,"title":"","content":"Life 4, Matter 3,<br /> <br /> Turn yourself into a stone.<br /> <br /> Good luck lifting yourself without limbs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkne