 b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8572\" data-vbnamecard=\"8572\">NicoTheDuck</a> your second one seems off spheres-wise to me. I don't see how to achieve the effect with the stated levels.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12193_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12193\" data-vbnamecard=\"12193\">Saikou</a> you realize that you can provide the stone with limbs (even if you must work without instruments) with another effect with the same spheres?<br /> <br /> Entropy 5, Prime 5, Time 5, Spirit 5, Matter 2<br /> A stone with a powerful fate:<br /> \u201cWhoever tries to lift this stone will be erased from the Books of Time, Life and Destiny.\u201c<br /> <br /> The person who tries to lift the stone will immediately loose his pattern, his past, previous and future incarnations and of course his fate as well as his Avatar. Thus rendering everyone unable to lift the stone. No one seems foolish enough to have attempted the feat(but the disturbance in the flow of Fate, Time and Prime hint at a possible attempt that of course can not be remembered)<br /> <br /> <b> Clap with only one hand</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T03:42:12-08:00","id":1028095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/978996-skinning-the-cat?p=1028090#post1028090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nice!<br /> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> your second one seems off spheres-wise to me. I don't see how to achieve the effect with the stated levels.<br /> <br /> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> you realize that you can provide the stone with limbs (even if you must work without instruments) with another effect with the same spheres?<br /> <br /> Entropy 5, Prime 5, Time 5, Spirit 5, Matter 2<br /> A stone with a powerful fate:<br /> \u201cWhoever tries to lift this stone will be erased from the Books of Time, Life and Destiny.\u201c<br /> <br /> The person who tries to lift the stone will immediately loose his pattern, his past, previous and future incarnations and of course his fate as well as his Avatar. Thus rendering everyone unable to lift the stone. No one seems foolish enough to have attempted the feat(but the disturbance in the flow of Fate, Time and Prime hint at a possible attempt that of course can not be remembered)</div> </div> </div> </div>If you have no limbs and require limbs for your focus, then no, you can't.<br /> <br /> Also, just because no one will know they picked up the rock doesn't mean they can't pick them up.<br /> <br /> That's like saying it's impossible for anyone to erase themselves from existence. It's not, it's just stupid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T04:09:28-08:00","id":1028101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/978996-skinning-the-cat?p=1028095#post1028095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If you have no limbs and require limbs for your focus, then no, you can't.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thats what surpassing focus rules are for.<br /> Difficult?<br /> Yes<br /> Impossible?<br /> No<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/978996-skinning-the-cat?p=1028095#post1028095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, just because no one will know they picked up the rock doesn't mean they can't pick them up.<br /> <br /> That's like saying it's impossible for anyone to erase themselves from existence. It's not, it's just stupid.</div> </div> </div> </div>I may have been unclear in my wording.<br /> That's what you get when you walk the dog while doing magick.\ud83d\ude02<br /> I'll try again:<br /> If you try to lift the stone, then you never existed in the first place, thus no one remembers that you tried.<br /> This effect extends into the past and the future and affects you, your Avatar and your Fate.<br /> This way you never existed and will never exist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T04:10:44-08:00","id":1028103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/978996-skinning-the-cat?p=1028101#post1028101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thats what surpassing focus rules are for.<br /> Difficult?<br /> Yes<br /> Impossible?<br /> No<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I may have been unclear in my wording.<br /> That's what you get when you walk the dog while doing magick.\ud83d\ude02<br /> I'll try again:<br /> If you try to lift the stone, then you never existed in the first place, thus no one remembers that you tried.<br /> This effect extends into the past and the future and affects you, your Avatar and your Fate.<br /> This way you never existed and will never exist.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You're still lifting the stone though.<br /> <br /> <br /> How about this. Create Zeno's Stone.<br /> <br /> Matter 4 Corr 4<br /> <br /> As you approach half way towards the stone, the distance between you and the stone becomes twice as long.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T05:21:16-08:00","id":1028122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/978996-skinning-the-cat?p=1028103#post1028103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> You're still lifting the stone though.<br /> <br /> <br /> How about this. Create Zeno's Stone.<br /> <br /> Matter 4 Corr 4<br /> <br /> As you approach half way towards the stone, the distance between you and the stone becomes twice as long.</div> </div> </div> </div>The moment you try to lift the stone is certainly several moments before you even touch the stone, much less lift it.<br /> <br /> Nico already created such an Stone, but the other way round. Halving the distance each time, thus never getting to zero distance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T09:55:39-08:00","id":1028196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nonsense</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/978996-skinning-the-cat?p=1028122#post1028122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The moment you try to lift the stone is certainly several moments before you even touch the stone, much less lift it.<br /> <br /> Nico already created such an Stone, but the other way round. Halving the distance each time, thus never getting to zero distance.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Whoops.<br /> <br /> Ok then. Last chance to get this to work.<br /> <br /> Matter 4/5, Entropy 4, Time 3,<br /> <br /> (Possibly Prime 4 or 3 instead of Matter 4/5 to make this an ongoing Wonder effect)<br /> <br /> Similar to the Zeno rock, except the closer you get to it, the faster you age. Your hand will crumble to dust before it has a chance to clench it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T22:24:39-08:00","id":1028435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/978996-skinning-the-cat?p=1028196#post1028196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Whoops.<br /> <br /> Ok then. Last chance to get this to work.<br /> <br /> Matter 4/5, Entropy 4, Time 3,<br /> <br /> (Possibly Prime 4 or 3 instead of Matter 4/5 to make this an ongoing Wonder effect)<br /> <br /> Similar to the Zeno rock, except the closer you get to it, the faster you age. Your hand will crumble to dust before it has a chance to clench it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Behold the Stone of Aging!<br /> <br /> Back to the new challenge:<br /> <br /> <b> Clap with one hand</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T04:17:41-08:00","id":1028497,"title":"","content":"Time 4.<br /> Put the rock into an essentially no-interval timeloop of sitting on the ground.<br /> <br /> You can't smash it, you can't move it, no matter what you do the rock is looped into its current condition and position in space.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The new 'Clap With one hand' challenge:<br /> <br /> Correspondence 4 - Colocate yourself (or just the hand) to face you. Clap with two hands that are actually the same hand.<br /> Forces 2 - Manipulate the kinetic force of your hand to have half of it move away from your hand as you reach outward, and move that half back against your hand as you move it inward. The claps get only half as loud, but you are now literally clapping with one single, non-colocated hand!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 01-08-2017, 07:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T03:09:36-08:00","id":1028939,"title":"","content":"Nice 1!<br /> I would add Correspondence 4 there.<br /> Timefields on objects tend to break if touched.<br /> <br /> Now to move it to another level:<br /> Time 5, Mind 3, Life 3<br /> Make the illusion of a clapping hand travel to the appropriate moments in time. So you have only to bother to cast this effect once, and don't have to hassle with instruments every time.(One effect gets colocated to multiple points on your timestream)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}